  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5271bcb418d363f0",
      "translationZh": "花了一个周末对 Splash 引擎（由 Incoai 开发）进行基准测试，并将其架构扩展到在 Apple Silicon 上的原生 8 位实现（M5 Pro，64 GB 统一内存）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f5321be9371a8c9",
      "translationZh": "Splash 是一个使用 C++ 和 Metal 编写的编译型投机解码引擎，专为 Apple Silicon 设计。上游的 Splash 为 4 位模型（约 60 token/秒）开创了极其快速的投机解码流水线。然而，激进的 4 位量化在竞争级别的数学运算和多步推导上会出现严重的“推理悬崖”。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3a3b1210b3415b2",
      "translationZh": "我们希望将 Splash 的速度提升到真正未压缩的 8 位权重，同时不失去其投机解码的优势。通过扩展 Splash 的架构以支持原生 8 位瓦片 Metal 内核（schema 5，MDFL0008），我们能够实现 37–55 tok/s 的吞吐量，并且没有量化退化。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "87b4c03a241dad2e",
      "translationZh": "模型权重（27 GB 原生 8 位）：https://huggingface.co/nitinpanj/Qwen3.8-27B-Splash-HQ",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0424c7665993de06",
      "translationZh": "Q8 Metal 运行时分支（Splash 扩展）：https://github.com/npanj/splash/tree/q8",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abd619c731a8d3e3",
      "translationZh": "预构建发布（无需编译）：https://github.com/npanj/splash/releases/tag/1.0-q8",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cfcf3220eff0ab28",
      "translationZh": "基准套件和原始 JSON 日志：https://github.com/npanj/splash-plus",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a99de20421d31e00",
      "translationZh": "基准测试与上下文扩展图：https://raw.githubusercontent.com/npanj/splash-plus/main/benchmark_and_context_scaling.png",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90a296a470305939",
      "translationZh": "兼容性说明：官方上游 Splash 1.0（incoai/splash）将包验证硬编码为 4 位模式（splash-packed-q4，模式 3/4）。此分支新增了模式 5（splash-packed-q8，MDFL0008）加载以及编译好的 Metal Q8 瓦片解码内核，同时保持与上游 Splash 官方 Q4 模型的 100% 向后兼容。提议的上游合并请求：incoai/splash#94（https://github.com/incoai/splash/pull/94）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32b5b8e39f750f45",
      "translationZh": "Apple Silicon（M5 Pro，64 GB 统一内存）上的速度",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "450b2901e05759de",
      "translationZh": "在5个标准化任务领域中，以temperature=0.0进行评估：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a2fef0c5a4bcb87",
      "translationZh": "任务/领域提示描述 Splash-Q4（官方 4b） Splash-HQ（本地 8b） Splash-Q8（压缩） MTPLX-Q8（MTP D3） Stock MLX / llama.cpp（AR）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b12684400153f3d4",
      "translationZh": "3-椅子空间排列",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e1d147e94dc8d44",
      "translationZh": "内存带宽限制",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9d7b17d437121a2",
      "translationZh": "相对于 9.9 t/s 基准",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1db46cf1bac7c7e0",
      "translationZh": "关于比较的几点说明：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0e41fca95ced95a",
      "translationZh": "Splash-HQ 与 MTPLX（整体提升 39%，数学提升 92%）：两者使用完全相同的 8 位基础权重。但 Splash 的编译型 C++ Metal 后端在调度开销上显著低于 Python/MLX DraftCore，实现了整体 36.9 tok/s 对比 26.5 tok/s 的吞吐，并在结构化数学推理时达到 54.8 tok/s。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "820ac8b3b0acdcf2",
      "translationZh": "精度‑速度悖论：未压缩的原生 8 位（Splash-HQ，27 GB）实际上平均运行速度略快于压缩的 8 位（Splash-Q8，17 GB）——分别为 36.9 与 36.5 token/秒。在推测解码中，解码速度等于草稿速度乘以接受率。激进的压缩会平滑 logits 并降低草稿接受率；原生 8 位产生更锐利的 logits，验证回滚更少，尽管从内存读取的字节更多，但净吞吐量更高。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0ca9b7ce3472218",
      "translationZh": "上下文扩展：256k 上下文（实时遥测至 190k）会发生什么",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1844b5dafd0787ea",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 在架构上规定了原生的 256k 上下文窗口（262,144 个标记）。大多数 Transformer 在上下文长度增加时解码速度会急剧下降，因为 KV 缓存会膨胀。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57590609e4ccb5e0",
      "translationZh": "然而，Qwen3.8 使用混合架构：48 层循环线性 DeltaNet（固定 128×128 隐藏状态，随上下文 O(1) 内存增长）以及仅 16 层全注意力层。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2a1ab90700be05c",
      "translationZh": "在一台 64 GB 的 Mac 上，我们在活跃的服务器会话中将其推至 190,016 个 token，以观察在真实使用情况下解码速度是否会下降。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "223c5517bab88ff2",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度（标记） 已缓存标记 生成的输出 TTFT（提示预填充） 解码速度 备注",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14742174dbae4648",
      "translationZh": "长响应生成",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "088d325db1c0a520",
      "translationZh": "深度上下文代码审查",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6de63c1fb49f00a3",
      "translationZh": "大规模批量生成",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1f62fd2145803ad",
      "translationZh": "缓存命中，使用了158k 令牌",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f493b342db739942",
      "translationZh": "扩展推理会话",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b0348833496275f",
      "translationZh": "缓存命中，使用了 187k 令牌",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43f3d065419a7b47",
      "translationZh": "部分预填重新计算",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8bc0b6977e9f53c",
      "translationZh": "已达到最大上下文（64GB RAM）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4b61773af28ec21",
      "translationZh": "（参见仓库中的可视化图表：benchmark_and_context_scaling.png，该图展示了完整的 51 个点散点图和滚动趋势线）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d41e1d764b3f1caa",
      "translationZh": "关于上下文的重要结论：解码速度并未崩溃。得益于 Splash 的内存处理机制和混合架构，在整个范围内，速度始终保持在 21 – 33 tok/s 之间。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e55f68f670682498",
      "translationZh": "在超过15万上下文长度时，真正的瓶颈是冷预填（TTFT）。当前缀缓存命中时，187k 上下文的 TTFT 仅为 6.5 秒。但在缓存未命中的情况下，对 27B 模型在 Apple Silicon 上预填 180k+ 令牌大约需要 4–5 分钟。如果你使用代理工具（如 Oh My Pi、Claude Code 或 curl），请确保客户端 SSE 空闲超时时间设置得足够高，以免在冷预填期间连接被客户端掉线。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be6a3d194ad535de",
      "translationZh": "竞争数学中的“推理悬崖”",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d06e9fce4cbff2f6",
      "translationZh": "如果数学推导出现幻觉，吞吐量数字就毫无意义。我们在 MATH-500、2025 年 AIME 和 GPQA Diamond 上测试了扩展的 CoT 推理。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8179c5b4147d532",
      "translationZh": "在 MATH-500 问题 0（评估 =1 \\ 无限）=1 \\ 无限）(1)/((j+k) 3) = p - q）中，股票 Splash-Q4 和压缩版 Splash-Q8 都掉进了悬崖：它们在代数级数操作的中途出现了数值漂移，导致输出错误的数值。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5be192e1b050682",
      "translationZh": "升级到 Splash-HQ（在全部 64 层上使用完整未压缩的 8 位）或 Splash-Mixed（仅在最高的 8 层敏感层，即第 56–63 层，使用 8 位）后，完全消除了悬崖现象，并且能够干净地推导出 p - q。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "988d92168d53229c",
      "translationZh": "仅升级最深的8层就恢复了完整的符号精度，同时保持了可管理的内存使用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7443960ab980daf9",
      "translationZh": "设置配方（无需编译）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e84f3c39cb2c08e",
      "translationZh": "需求：Apple Silicon Mac，macOS 26.4 或更高版本，48 GB 统一内存（建议 64 GB；仅模型权重就占 27 GB）。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c947233f67e5c924",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 仓库包含 C++ 和 Metal 运行时引擎，而 27 GB 的模型权重则托管在 Hugging Face 上。您无需使用 git-lfs 或单独脚本手动下载模型文件——Splash 已内置包下载器。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1023d01b5a69be8f",
      "translationZh": "1. 安装预构建引擎（单行）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01013d9906ffec51",
      "translationZh": "无需 Xcode、Homebrew 或 pip。它会安装 splash-q8 命令，并且不会替换已有的 Homebrew splash。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8b561ec17cfe2779",
      "translationZh": "2. 启动服务器（首次运行时自动下载）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2de8ba67c613b21",
      "translationZh": "当您运行以下命令时，Splash 会自动检测缺失的模型制品，连接到 Hugging Face，使用进度条流式下载 27 GB 的文件，验证清单的 SHA-256 哈希，并启动引擎。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b43de163663604c",
      "translationZh": "（一旦下载完成，后续运行将从本地磁盘离线即时加载。）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "521bf2edcfdc5421",
      "translationZh": "（可选：如果您更倾向于先通过 Hugging Face CLI 预先下载模型文件，则可以运行：）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c9d88a87aa46cef",
      "translationZh": "3. 连接您的客户端",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19840a82d7248fb7",
      "translationZh": "服务器在 http://127.0.0.1:8000 上公开了一个符合 OpenAI 标准的 /v1/chat/completions 接口。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f34412460cbcf71d",
      "translationZh": "改为从源码构建？你需要完整的 Xcode，而不仅仅是命令行工具。在 Xcode 26 上，首先运行 xcodebuild -downloadComponent MetalToolchain，然后执行 make -j4。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0a394cca8923e7c",
      "translationZh": "实用的陷阱与细节",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eab51edd1d0551c7",
      "translationZh": "在150k以上的上下文下的内存余量：在一台64 GB的Mac上，模型权重约占27 GB。随着上下文长度接近180k–190k，工作内存会升至约42 GiB。当系统空闲RAM降至约50 MB以下时，Metal的内存管理器会暂停内存分配增长（内存：增长已暂停）。如果不需要190k的上下文，可以使用 --max-context 131072 将其干净地限制在该值。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68a5da31127136c2",
      "translationZh": "向后兼容性：`splash-q8` 也支持官方的 4 位模型。此分支保留了上游 Splash 4 位密集和 MoE 架构（splash-packed-q4、splash-packed-q4-moe），因此您可以直接使用官方模型，如 incoai/Qwen3.8-27B-Splash 或 incoai/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Splash。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0deb52465ddc07b",
      "translationZh": "仅在 Apple Silicon（统一内存）上测试：此处所有内容均依赖统一内存带宽和 Metal 瓦片着色器；未在 CUDA 或 CPU 上测试。",
